884-9.885 9.884m8.413-18.297A11.815 11.815 0 0012.05 0C5.495 0 .16 5.335.157 11.892c0 2.096.547 4.142 1.588 5.945L.057 24l6.305-1.654a11.882 11.882 0 005.683 1.448h.005c6.554 0 11.89-5.335 11.893-11.893a11.821 11.821 0 00-3.48-8.413Z\"></path></svg></button></div><main class=\"pt-28 md:pt-32\"><div class=\"border-b border-ink/10 px-6 py-16 md:px-16 md:py-24\"><div class=\"transition-all duration-1000 ease-out translate-y-8 opacity-0\" style=\"transition-delay:0ms\"><p class=\"mb-6 font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.3em] text-green\">The Journal</p><h1 class=\"font-serif font-semibold leading-[1.05] text-[clamp(2.5rem,6vw,5rem)]\">Notes from the field.</h1><p class=\"mt-6 max-w-xl leading-[1.8] text-muted\">Every article begins as a real audit. We write down what broke, why it broke, and the 101 behind the cure — so you can spot the fault in your own business before it costs you.</p></div></div><div class=\"px-6 md:px-16\"><div class=\"transition-all duration-1000 ease-out translate-y-8 opacity-0\" style=\"transition-delay:0ms\"><a class=\"group block border-b border-ink/10 py-10 transition-colors hover:bg-surface/40 md:py-14\" href=\"/journal/who-really-needs-a-website\"><div class=\"flex items-baseline justify-between font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.25em] text-muted\"><span class=\"text-green\">Web Platforms</span><time dateTime=\"2026-08-17\">2026-08-17</time></div><h2 class=\"mt-4 max-w-3xl font-serif font-semibold text-2xl transition-colors group-hover:text-green md:text-4xl\">Not Every Business Needs a Website. These Three Can&#x27;t Afford to Be Invisible.</h2><p class=\"mt-4 max-w-2xl leading-[1.8] text-muted\">Before the call, before the site visit, before the quotation, someone is already checking you. For property companies, medical suppliers and schools, that evaluation often starts online.</p><span class=\"mt-6 inline-flex items-center gap-2 border-b border-ink/30 pb-1 text-sm uppercase tracking-widest transition-colors group-hover:border-green group-hover:text-green\">Read the field report <svg width=\"11\" height=\"11\" viewBox=\"0 0 12 12\" fill=\"none\" class=\"transition-transform duration-300 group-hover:translate-x-1 group-hover:-translate-y-1\"><path d=\"M2 10L10 2M10 2H4M10 2V8\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"></path></svg></span></a></div><div class=\"transition-all duration-1000 ease-out translate-y-8 opacity-0\" style=\"transition-delay:0ms\"><a class=\"group block border-b border-ink/10 py-10 transition-colors hover:bg-surface/40 md:py-14\" href=\"/journal/the-melted-cable\"><div class=\"flex items-baseline justify-between font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.25em] text-muted\"><span class=\"text-green\">Network &amp; Infrastructure</span><time dateTime=\"2026-08-17\">2026-08-17</time></div><h2 class=\"mt-4 max-w-3xl font-serif font-semibold text-2xl transition-colors group-hover:text-green md:text-4xl\">The Network That Worked Until It Didn&#x27;t</h2><p class=\"mt-4 max-w-2xl leading-[1.8] text-muted\">Indoor cable exposed to the sun. Unmanaged switches. No patch panels. No documentation. A school network built to get by, not to support hundreds of students.</p><span class=\"mt-6 inline-flex items-center gap-2 border-b border-ink/30 pb-1 text-sm uppercase tracking-widest transition-colors group-hover:border-green group-hover:text-green\">Read the field report <svg width=\"11\" height=\"11\" viewBox=\"0 0 12 12\" fill=\"none\" class=\"transition-transform duration-300 group-hover:translate-x-1 group-hover:-translate-y-1\"><path d=\"M2 10L10 2M10 2H4M10 2V8\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"></path></svg></span></a></div><div class=\"transition-all duration-1000 ease-out translate-y-8 opacity-0\" style=\"transition-delay:0ms\"><a class=\"group block border-b border-ink/10 py-10 transition-colors hover:bg-surface/40 md:py-14\" href=\"/journal/manual-workflow\"><div class=\"flex items-baseline justify-between font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.25em] text-muted\"><span class=\"text-green\">Custom Applications</span><time dateTime=\"2026-08-17\">2026-08-17</time></div><h2 class=\"mt-4 max-w-3xl font-serif font-semibold text-2xl transition-colors group-hover:text-green md:text-4xl\">Your Business Should Not Need a Human Bridge Between Every System</h2><p class=\"mt-4 max-w-2xl leading-[1.8] text-muted\">WhatsApp orders. Spreadsheets. Approval messages. Repeated data entry. Follow-up calls. When people become the connection between disconnected processes, the business starts paying for the gaps.</p><span class=\"mt-6 inline-flex items-center gap-2 border-b border-ink/30 pb-1 text-sm uppercase tracking-widest transition-colors group-hover:border-green group-hover:text-green\">Read the field report <svg width=\"11\" height=\"11\" viewBox=\"0 0 12 12\" fill=\"none\" class=\"transition-transform duration-300 group-hover:translate-x-1 group-hover:-translate-y-1\"><path d=\"M2 10L10 2M10 2H4M10 2V8\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"></path></svg></span></a></div></div></main><!--$--><!--/$--><script id=\"_R_\">(globalThis[\"TURBOPACK\"] || (globalThis[\"TURBOPACK\"] = [])).push({\"otherChunks\":[\"static/chunks/1pcw6gskne7pf.js\",\"static/chunks/0vm8zo6v48m9c.js\",\"static/chunks/2-liacn1-fmrj.js\",\"static/chunks/3ncqdelv46e8a.js\"],\"runtimeModuleIds\":[94553]});</script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/1pcw6gskne7pf.js\" async=\"\"></script><script>(self.__next_f=self.__next_f||[]).push([0])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"1:\\\"$Sreact.fragment\\\"\\n2:\\\"/_next/static/chunks/3qfy96eoyh-ek.js\\\"\\n3:\\\"/_next/static/chunks/1_q4oc079m3pu.js\\\"\\n4:I[84834,[\\\"$2\\\",\\\"$3\\\"],\\\"default\\\"]\\n5:I[88115,[\\\"$2\\\",\\\"$3\\\"],\\\"default\\\"]\\n6:I[39756,[\\\"$2\\\",\\\"$3\\\"],\\\"default\\\"]\\n7:I[37457,[\\\"$2\\\",\\\"$3\\\"],\\\"default\\\"]\\nb:\\\"/_next/static/chunks/3-ngaflt5dk3r.js\\\"\\nc:I[96199,[\\\"$2\\\",\\\"$3\\\",\\\"$b\\\"],\\\"default\\\"]\\nd:I[22016,[\\\"$2\\